[
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 2.025,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Welcome back to Sessions Sentier.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 49,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s01"
},
{
"start": 2.025,
"end": 8.408,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Today, we're talking about enduro racing, and I'm joined by Élodie Chevalier, an enduro rider and coach.",
"char_start": 50,
"char_end": 154,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 8.408,
"end": 11.047,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Élodie Chevalier, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 155,
"char_end": 198,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 11.047,
"end": 12.893,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Thank you, Camille.",
"char_start": 217,
"char_end": 236,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 12.893,
"end": 14.448,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Glad to be back.",
"char_start": 237,
"char_end": 253,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 14.448,
"end": 16.956,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This episode is sponsored by Linear.",
"char_start": 270,
"char_end": 306,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 16.956,
"end": 22.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed – built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 307,
"char_end": 382,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 22.18,
"end": 23.643,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try linear.com today.",
"char_start": 383,
"char_end": 404,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 23.643,
"end": 31.913,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details, Julien Mercier was on the show and explained that drainage is the most crucial design choice.",
"char_start": 405,
"char_end": 530,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 31.913,
"end": 32.682,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 549,
"char_end": 562,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.682,
"end": 35.64,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 563,
"char_end": 613,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.64,
"end": 41.471,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point out something – Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 630,
"char_end": 724,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 41.471,
"end": 43.215,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 725,
"char_end": 752,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 43.215,
"end": 46.444,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 753,
"char_end": 803,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 46.444,
"end": 52.031,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, the increased speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 822,
"char_end": 923,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 52.031,
"end": 54.409,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 924,
"char_end": 967,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 54.409,
"end": 58.226,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 968,
"char_end": 1037,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 58.226,
"end": 59.806,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 1054,
"char_end": 1085,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 59.806,
"end": 62.355,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1086,
"char_end": 1136,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 62.355,
"end": 62.882,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1155,
"char_end": 1165,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 62.882,
"end": 67.943,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 1166,
"char_end": 1262,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 67.943,
"end": 71.897,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The setup is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1263,
"char_end": 1338,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 71.897,
"end": 73.18,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 1355,
"char_end": 1377,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 73.18,
"end": 76.096,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro racing intersect?",
"char_start": 1378,
"char_end": 1428,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 76.096,
"end": 82.678,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Honestly, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 1447,
"char_end": 1562,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 82.678,
"end": 85.082,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1563,
"char_end": 1605,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 85.082,
"end": 90.005,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1606,
"char_end": 1692,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 90.005,
"end": 91.633,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where is it no longer working?",
"char_start": 1709,
"char_end": 1739,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 91.633,
"end": 95.637,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is particularly evident.",
"char_start": 1758,
"char_end": 1839,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 95.637,
"end": 98.999,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1840,
"char_end": 1908,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 98.999,
"end": 101.89,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 1925,
"char_end": 1968,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 101.89,
"end": 104.58,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1969,
"char_end": 2009,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 104.58,
"end": 105.716,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2028,
"char_end": 2048,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 105.716,
"end": 113.215,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the special stages change the choice of racing line between the reconnaissance runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 2049,
"char_end": 2181,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 113.215,
"end": 117.248,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Once you've internalized that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 2182,
"char_end": 2253,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 117.248,
"end": 122.683,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we continue, please support the program by visiting the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2270,
"char_end": 2356,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 122.683,
"end": 124.642,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
"char_start": 2357,
"char_end": 2388,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 124.642,
"end": 128.527,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
"char_start": 2389,
"char_end": 2440,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
