},
{
"start": 144.23,
"end": 146.113,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Welcome back to the show.",
"char_start": 2611,
"char_end": 2636,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s01"
},
{
"start": 146.113,
"end": 147.784,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to delve into that further.",
"char_start": 2637,
"char_end": 2671,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 147.784,
"end": 150.192,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 2672,
"char_end": 2721,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 150.192,
"end": 153.213,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 2740,
"char_end": 2791,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 153.213,
"end": 158.01,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 2792,
"char_end": 2873,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 158.01,
"end": 160.557,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 2874,
"char_end": 2917,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 160.557,
"end": 164.407,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 2918,
"char_end": 2983,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 164.407,
"end": 166.64,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 3000,
"char_end": 3037,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 166.64,
"end": 170.984,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational aspect that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3038,
"char_end": 3110,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 170.984,
"end": 176.763,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, so – tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than minor suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 3129,
"char_end": 3235,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 176.763,
"end": 180.852,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The setup is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 3236,
"char_end": 3311,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 180.852,
"end": 182.525,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3328,
"char_end": 3355,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 182.525,
"end": 185.56,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 3356,
"char_end": 3405,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 185.56,
"end": 192.567,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Yes, so – risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 3424,
"char_end": 3539,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 192.567,
"end": 195.187,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 3540,
"char_end": 3583,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 195.187,
"end": 198.964,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
