"char_end": 3646,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 198.964,
"end": 199.735,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 3663,
"char_end": 3676,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.735,
"end": 204.39,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is particularly evident.",
"char_start": 3695,
"char_end": 3776,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 204.39,
"end": 208.24,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3777,
"char_end": 3844,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s02"
},
{
"start": 208.24,
"end": 209.5,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3861,
"char_end": 3883,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 209.5,
"end": 212.706,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of enduro racing?",
"char_start": 3884,
"char_end": 3940,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 212.706,
"end": 220.632,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "It boils down to this: the erosion patterns on the special stages change the optimal racing line between the reconnaissance runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 3959,
"char_end": 4112,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 220.632,
"end": 223.844,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4113,
"char_end": 4175,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 223.844,
"end": 228.551,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject – I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4192,
"char_end": 4275,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 228.551,
"end": 236.596,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4294,
"char_end": 4434,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 236.596,
"end": 238.824,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 4451,
"char_end": 4488,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 238.824,
"end": 243.161,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the counter-flow angle that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 4489,
"char_end": 4561,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 243.161,
"end": 243.722,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 4580,
"char_end": 4590,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 243.722,
"end": 248.825,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The increased speed comes from braking earlier and more gently, not from taking more risks.",
"char_start": 4591,
"char_end": 4682,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.825,
"end": 251.236,
