"char_start": 5130,
"char_end": 5179,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 274.677,
"end": 277.529,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I'm giving you the version that I truly believe in.",
"char_start": 5198,
"char_end": 5249,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 277.529,
"end": 283.402,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes are survivable.",
"char_start": 5250,
"char_end": 5355,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 283.402,
"end": 286.142,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 5356,
"char_end": 5405,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 286.142,
"end": 289.61,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5406,
"char_end": 5468,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s04"
},
{
"start": 289.61,
"end": 290.474,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "It's settled.\nAlternatively:\nIt's a done deal.\nIt's confirmed.\nIt's arranged.\nIt's agreed.\n(The best option depends on the specific context.)",
"char_start": 5485,
"char_end": 5626,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 290.474,
"end": 298.751,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-off becomes apparent – I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5645,
"char_end": 5798,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 298.751,
"end": 301.392,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 5815,
"char_end": 5858,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 301.392,
"end": 304.401,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Which version of the question is truly important?",
"char_start": 5859,
"char_end": 5908,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 304.401,
"end": 305.453,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 5927,
"char_end": 5947,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 305.453,
"end": 312.394,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "The erosion patterns on the special stages change the choice of racing line between the reconnaissance runs and the actual race day.",
"char_start": 5948,
"char_end": 6080,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 312.394,
"end": 315.444,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "I saw this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 6081,
"char_end": 6139,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s03"
},
{
"start": 315.444,
"end": 320.175,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
"char_start": 6156,
"char_end": 6227,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 320.175,
"end": 323.971,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6246,
"char_end": 6310,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 323.971,
"end": 326.047,
"speaker_label": "Élodie Chevalier",
"text": "Everything else is about iteration.",
"char_start": 6311,
"char_end": 6346,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
